  "solution": "We substitute the values in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\n12 + 156 × __**13 ÷ 6**__ - 100 = 50\n\n12 + __**156 × **__**__2.1__** - 100 = 50\n\n__**12 + **3____27.6__ - 100 = 50\n\n__**339.6 - 100**__ = 50\n\n239.6 ≠ 50\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\n12 × __**156 ÷ 13**__ + 6 - 100 = 50\n\n__**12 **____**× **12__ + 6 - 100 = 50\n\n__**144 + 6**__ - 100 = 50\n\n__**150 - 100**__ = 50\n\n50 = 50\n\nOption 3) - and ×\n\n12 + __**156 ÷ 13**__ - 6 × 100 = 50\n\n12 + 12 - __**6 **____**×**____** 100 **__= 50\n\n__**12 + 12**__ - **6****00 **= 50\n\n__**24 - 600**__ = 50 \n\n576 ≠ 50 \n\nOption 4) ÷ and -\n\n12 + 156 - 13 × __**6 ÷ 100**__ = 50\n\n12 + 156 - __**13 × 0.0**____6__ = 50\n\n__**12 + 156**__ - 0.78 = 50\n\n168 - 0.78 = 50\n\n167.22 ≠ 50\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2).**",
